004	NUM	028	025	Pazuva rechinomwe muite ungano tsvene uye murege kuita basa ramazuva ose.
004	NUM	028	026	“‘Pazuva rezvibereko zvokutanga, pamunopa zvipiriso zvenyu kuna Jehovha, zvezvitsva zvezviyo panguva yoMutambo weMavhiki, muite ungano tsvene uye murege kuita basa ramazuva ose.
004	NUM	028	027	Mupe chipiriso chinopiswa chehando duku mbiri, gondobwe rimwe chete uye makwayana manomwe makono egore rimwe chete, chive chipiriso chinofadza kuna Jehovha.
004	NUM	028	028	Pamwe chete nehando imwe neimwe, panofanira kuva nechipiriso chezviyo chezvikamu zvitatu mugumi zveefa yeupfu hwakatsetseka hwakavhenganiswa namafuta; pamwe chete negondobwe, zvikamu zviviri mugumi;
004	NUM	028	029	uye nerimwe nerimwe ramakwayana manomwe, chikamu chimwe chete mugumi.
