004	NUM	029	003	Mugadzire pamwe chete nehando duku chipiriso chezviyo chezvikamu zvitatu mugumi zveefa yeupfu hwakatsetseka hwakavhenganiswa pamwe chete namafuta, negondobwe, zvikamu zviviri mugumi;
004	NUM	029	004	pamwe chete nerimwe nerimwe ramakwayana manomwe, chikamu chimwe chete mugumi.
