018	JOB	010	021	ndisati ndaenda kusingadzokwi, kunyika yerima nomumvuri wakadzama,
018	JOB	010	022	kunyika yerima guru, yomumvuri wakadzama nenyonganyonga, iko kunoti kunyange chiedza chakangofanana nerima.”
018	JOB	011	001	Ipapo Zofari muNaamati akapindura akati:
018	JOB	011	002	“Mashoko aya ose haangapindurwi here? Ko, mutauri uyu anofanira kushayirwa mhosva here?
018	JOB	011	003	Ko, kubvotomoka kwako kunganyaradza vanhu here? Ko, pangashaya anokutsiura paunenge uchituka here?
018	JOB	011	004	Iwe unoti kuna Mwari, ‘Zvandinotenda zvakarurama uye ndakachena pamberi penyu.’
018	JOB	011	005	Haiwa, ndinoda sei kuti dai Mwari ataura, kuti dai ashamisa hake muromo wake pamusoro pako,
018	JOB	011	006	uye akuzarurire zvakavanzika zvouchenjeri, nokuti uchenjeri hwechokwadi huri paviri. Uzive izvi: Mwari akatokanganwa kare zvimwe zvivi zvako.
018	JOB	011	007	“Ko, unganzwisisa zvakavanzika zvaMwari here? Unganzwisisa panogumira Wamasimba Ose here?
018	JOB	011	008	Zvakakwirira kupfuura matenga, iwe ungaiteiko? Zvakadzika kupfuura kudzika kwebwiro, iwe ungaziveiko?
018	JOB	011	009	Chiero chazvo chakareba kupfuura nyika uye zvakapamhama kupfuura gungwa.
018	JOB	011	010	“Kana iye akasvika akakupfigira mujeri uye akakoka dare remhosva, ndianiko angapikisana naye?
018	JOB	011	011	Zvirokwazvo anoziva vanhu vanonyengera; uye paanoona chakaipa, anoshaya hanya here?
018	JOB	011	012	Asi munhu asina kuchenjera haangagoni kuva akangwara sezvo zvisingagoneki kuti mwana wembizi angaberekwa nomunhu.
018	JOB	011	013	“Asi kana mwoyo wako ukazvipira kwaari, uye ukatambanudzira maoko ako kwaari,
018	JOB	011	014	kana ukaisa kure chivi chiri muruoko rwako, uye ukasatendera chakaipa kugara mutende rako,
018	JOB	011	015	ipapo uchasimudza chiso chako usina nyadzi, uchamira wakasimba uye usingatyi.
018	JOB	011	016	Zvirokwazvo uchakanganwa nhamo yako, uchangoirangarira semvura yakaerera.
018	JOB	011	017	Upenyu huchajeka kupfuura masikati makuru, uye rima richaita samangwanani.
018	JOB	011	018	Iwe uchagara zvakanaka, nokuti tariro iriko; ucharinga-ringa ugozorora murugare.
018	JOB	011	019	Uchavata hako pasi, pasina munhu anokuvhundutsa, uye vazhinji vachakumbira nyasha dzako.
018	JOB	011	020	Asi meso avakaipa achaneta, uye vachashayiwa kwokutizira; tariro yavo ichava yokufa.”
018	JOB	012	001	Ipapo Jobho akapindura akati:
018	JOB	012	002	“Zvirokwazvo imi muri vanhu, uye uchenjeri huchafa nemi!
018	JOB	012	003	Asi neniwo ndinonzwisisa semi; handisi muduku kwamuri. Ndianiko asingazivi zvinhu zvose izvi?
018	JOB	012	004	“Ndava chiseko kushamwari dzangu, kunyange ndakadana kuna Mwari akapindura, ndava chiseko zvacho, kunyange ndakarurama uye ndisina chandingapomerwa!
018	JOB	012	005	Varume vagere zvakanaka vanoshora nhamo, vachiti ndiwo magumo avaya vane tsoka dzinotedzemuka.
018	JOB	012	006	Matende amakororo haakanganiswe, uye vaya vanotsamwisa Mwari vagere zvakanaka, ivo vanotakura mwari wavo mumaoko avo.
018	JOB	012	007	“Asi bvunza mhuka, uye dzichakudzidzisa, kana shiri dzedenga, idzo dzichakuudza;
018	JOB	012	008	kana taura kunyika, ichakudzidzisa, kana hove dzegungwa ngadzikuzivise.
018	JOB	012	009	Ndechipiko pane zvose izvi chisingazivi kuti ruoko rwaJehovha rwakaita izvi?
018	JOB	012	010	Upenyu hwezvisikwa zvose huri muruoko rwake, nokufema kwavanhu vamarudzi ose.
018	JOB	012	011	Ko, nzeve haiedzi mashoko sorurimi runoravira chokudya here?
018	JOB	012	012	Ko, uchenjeri hahuwanikwi pakati pavatana here? Ko, kuwanda kwoupenyu hakuuyisi kunzwisisa here?
018	JOB	012	013	“Uchenjeri nesimba ndezvaMwari; kudzidzisa nokunzwisisa ndezvake.
018	JOB	012	014	Zvaanenge akoromora hakuna anozvivakazve; murume waanenge apfigira mujeri haangasunungurwi.
018	JOB	012	015	Kana akadzivisa kunaya kwemvura, kuoma kunovapo; kana akairegedzera, nyika inoparadzwa.
018	JOB	012	016	Simba nokukunda ndezvake; anonyengerwa nomunyengeri vose ndevake.
018	JOB	012	017	Anodzinga makurukota asina nguo uye anoita kuti vatongi vave mapenzi.
018	JOB	012	018	Anobvisa zvisungo zvakaiswa namadzimambo agosunga zviuno zvavo nomucheka.
018	JOB	012	019	Anodzinga vaprista vasina nguo uye anobvisa pachigaro vanhu vakanguri vadzika midzi.
018	JOB	012	020	Anofumbira miromo yavapi vamazano vavanovimba navo, uye anobvisa kunzwisisa kwavakuru.
018	JOB	012	021	Anodurura kushorwa pamakurukota uye anokutunura zvombo zvavane simba.
