018	JOB	012	025	Vanotsvanzvadzira murima vasina chiedza; anoita kuti vadzedzereke sezvidhakwa.
018	JOB	013	001	“Meso angu akaona izvi zvose, nzeve dzangu dzakanzwa dzikazvinzwisisa.
018	JOB	013	002	Zvamunoziva imi, neniwo ndinozviziva; handisi muduku kwamuri.
018	JOB	013	003	Asi ndinoshuva kutaura naWamasimba Ose uye ndigozvidavirira nyaya yangu kuna Mwari.
018	JOB	013	004	Kunyange zvakadaro, imi munondizora nhema; muri varapi vasina maturo, imi mose!
018	JOB	013	005	Haiwa, dai bedzi mainyarara henyu! Nokuti hungava uchenjeri kwamuri.
018	JOB	013	006	Chinzwai zvino kuzvidavirira kwangu; teererai munzwe kudemba kwemiromo yangu.
018	JOB	013	007	Ko, mungataura zvakaipa muchimiririra Mwari here? Ko, mungataura zvinonyengera muchiti matumwa naye here?
018	JOB	013	008	Mungamuitira rusaruro here? Mungamiririra Mwari here?
