018	JOB	014	020	Munomukunda kamwe chete zvachose, uye akasazovapo; munoshandura chiso chake mobva mamudzinga.
018	JOB	014	021	Kana vanakomana vake vachikudzwa, iye haazvizivi; kana vakadzikisirwa pasi, iye haazvioni.
018	JOB	014	022	Anongonzwa kurwadza kwomuviri wake chete, agozvichema iye pachake bedzi.”
018	JOB	015	001	Ipapo Erifazi muTemani akapindura akati:
018	JOB	015	002	“Ko, munhu akachenjera angapindura zvisina njere here, kana kuzadza dumbu rake nemhepo inopisa yokumabvazuva?
018	JOB	015	003	Ko, angakakavara namashoko asina maturo, kana namashoko asina basa here?
018	JOB	015	004	Asi unotorwisa umwari uye unodzivisa kunamata Mwari.
