018	JOB	015	018	zvakataurwa navanhu vakachenjera, vasingavanzi chinhu chavakagamuchira kubva kumadzibaba avo,
018	JOB	015	019	ivo voga vakapiwa nyika pasina mutorwa akapfuura napakati pavo:
018	JOB	015	020	Murume akaipa anotambudzika nokurwadziwa pamazuva ake ose, makore ose outsinye akachengeterwa iye.
018	JOB	015	021	Maungira anotyisa anozadza nzeve dzake; pazvinenge zvaita sezvakanaka, vapambi vanomurwisa.
018	JOB	015	022	Anorasikirwa netariro yokupunyuka parima; munondo ndiwo waakatarirwa.
018	JOB	015	023	Anofamba-famba achiita sechokudya zvamagora; anoziva kuti zuva rerima raswedera.
018	JOB	015	024	Kutambudzika nokurwadziwa zvinomuzadza nokutya; zvinomukunda, samambo agadzirira kurwisa,
018	JOB	015	025	nokuti anokungira Mwari chibhakera chake uye anozvikudza pamusoro paWamasimba Ose,
018	JOB	015	026	achimhanyira kwaari asingatyi ane nhoo hobvu, yakasimba.
018	JOB	015	027	“Kunyange chiso chake chakafukidzwa namafuta uye chiuno chake chakafuta nenyama,
018	JOB	015	028	iye achagara mumaguta akaparadzwa nomudzimba dzisingagarwi nomunhu, dzimba dzokoromoka kuva marara.
018	JOB	015	029	Haachazovazve mupfumi uye pfuma yake haingagari, kana nepfuma yake haingazadzi nyika.
018	JOB	015	030	Haangapunyuki rima; murazvo uchasvavisa mabukira ake, uye kufema kwomuromo waMwari kuchamurasira kure.
018	JOB	015	031	Ngaarege kuzvinyengera nokuvimba nezvisina maturo, nokuti haana chaachawana pazviri.
018	JOB	015	032	Acharipirwa zvakazara nguva yake isati yasvika, uye matavi ake haangawandi.
018	JOB	015	033	Achafanana nomuzambiringa wabvisirwa mazambiringa asati aibva, kufanana nomuti womuorivhi wodonhedza maruva awo.
018	JOB	015	034	Nokuti ungano yavasingadi Mwari ichashaya zvibereko, uye moto uchaparadza matende avaya vanofarira fufuro.
018	JOB	015	035	Vanobata mimba yokutambudzika vagozvara zvakaipa; dumbu ravo rinogadzira kunyengera.”
018	JOB	016	001	Ipapo Jobho akapindura akati:
018	JOB	016	002	“Ndakanzwa zvinhu zvakawanda sezvizvi; mose muri vanyaradzi pasina!
