018	JOB	016	021	anomira pachinzvimbo chomunhu achikumbira kuna Mwari, somunhu anokumbirira shamwari yake.
018	JOB	016	022	“Makore mashoma bedzi asara, ndisati ndaenda parwendo rusingadzokwi.
018	JOB	017	001	Mweya wangu waputsika, mazuva angu aitwa mashoma, guva rakandimirira.
018	JOB	017	002	Zvirokwazvo vaseki vakandipoteredza; meso angu anofanira kuramba akatarisa ruvengo rwavo.
018	JOB	017	003	“Ndipei, imi Mwari, chitsidzo chamunoda. Ndianiko achandiisira rubatso?
018	JOB	017	004	Makapofumadza ndangariro dzavo pakunzwisisa; naizvozvo hamungavatenderi kukunda.
