018	JOB	017	006	“Mwari akandiita shumo kuvanhu vose, munhu anopfirwa mate kumeso kwake navanhu.
018	JOB	017	007	Meso angu aneta nokuchema; muviri wangu wose wangova mumvuri zvawo.
018	JOB	017	008	Vanhu vakarurama vanokatyamadzwa nazvo; vasina mhaka vachamukira vasingadi Mwari.
018	JOB	017	009	Kunyange zvakadaro, vakarurama vachabatirira panzira dzavo, uye vana maoko akachena vachanyanya kusimba.
