018	JOB	032	001	Saka varume vatatu ava vakarega kupindura Jobho, nokuti akanga akarurama pakuona kwake.
018	JOB	032	002	Asi Erihu mwanakomana waBharakeri muBhuzi, wemhuri yaRami, akatsamwira Jobho zvikuru nokuda kwokuzviruramisira kwake panzvimbo yokuti zviitwe naMwari.
018	JOB	032	003	Akatsamwirawo kwazvo shamwari nhatu idzi, nokuti vakanga vashayiwa nzira yokupikisa nayo Jobho, kunyange vakanga vambomupa mhosva.
