018	JOB	038	001	Ipapo Jehovha akapindura Jobho ari mudutu akati:
018	JOB	038	002	“Ndianiko uyu anodzimaidza zano rangu namashoko asina zivo?
018	JOB	038	003	Chizvishingisa somurume; ini ndichakubvunza, uye iwe uchandipindura.
018	JOB	038	004	“Iwe wakanga uripi pandakaisa nheyo dzenyika? Ndiudze, kana uchinzwisisa.
018	JOB	038	005	Ndianiko akatara miganhu yacho? Zvirokwazvo unozviziva! Ndianiko akaiyera nerwodzi?
018	JOB	038	006	Ko, nheyo dzayo dzakanga dzimire pai, kana kuti ndianiko akaisa ibwe rapakona,
018	JOB	038	007	panguva yaiimba nyeredzi dzamangwanani pamwe chete, uye vanakomana vaMwari vose vachipembera nomufaro?
018	JOB	038	008	“Ndianiko akapfigira gungwa mikova parakatsemuka richibva muchizvaro,
018	JOB	038	009	pandakaita makore kuti ave nguo yaro, uye ndikariputira murima guru,
018	JOB	038	010	pandakariisira miganhu yaro, uye ndikaisa makonhi aro namazariro panzvimbo yawo,
018	JOB	038	011	pandakati, ‘Apa ndipo paunosvika uye haungapfuuri; pano ndipo panoguma kuzvikudza kwamafungu ako’?
018	JOB	038	012	“Wakambopa mutemo kumangwanani here, kana kuratidza mambakwedza nzvimbo yawo,
018	JOB	038	013	kuti abate mipendero yenyika, uye azungunuse vakaipa kuti vabve mairi?
018	JOB	038	014	Nyika inoumbika sevhu pasi pechisimbiso; mamiriro ayo anoita senguo.
018	JOB	038	015	Vakaipa vanonyimwa chiedza chavo, uye ruoko rwavo rwakasimudzwa rwavhunika.
018	JOB	038	016	“Wakamboshanyira zvitubu zvegungwa here, kana kufamba kwakanyarara kwokwakadzika?
018	JOB	038	017	Ko, masuo orufu wakamboaratidzwa here? Wakamboona masuo omumvuri worufu here?
018	JOB	038	018	Wati wanzwisisa upamhi hwenzvimbo dzenyika here? Ndiudze kana uchiziva zvose izvi.
018	JOB	038	019	“Ko, nzira inoenda kunogara chiedza ndeipi? Ko, rima rinogarepi?
018	JOB	038	020	Ungagona kuzviisa kunzvimbo yazvo here? Unoziva nzira inoenda kwazvinogara here?
018	JOB	038	021	Zvirokwazvo iwe unoziva, nokuti wakanga waberekwa kare! Wararama kwamakore mazhinji kwazvo.
018	JOB	038	022	“Wakambopinda mudura rechando here, kana kuona dura rechimvuramabwe,
018	JOB	038	023	izvo zvandakachengetera nguva dzokutambudzika, mazuva ehondo neokurwa?
018	JOB	038	024	Ko, nzira inoenda kunogoverwa mheni ndeipi, kana nzvimbo inoparadzirwa mhepo dzokumabvazuva pamusoro penyika?
018	JOB	038	025	Ndianiko anodziura mugero wemvura zhinji, nenzira yechimvuramabwe,
018	JOB	038	026	kuti zvidiridze nyika isingagarwi nomunhu, gwenga risina munhu mariri,
018	JOB	038	027	kugutsa nyika yakaparadzwa nokuita kuti imere uswa?
018	JOB	038	028	Ko, mvura ina baba here? Ndianiko baba vemadonhwe edova?
018	JOB	038	029	Chando chinobva muchizvaro chaaniko? Ndianiko anobereka mazaya echando achibva kudenga,
018	JOB	038	030	panooma mvura ikaita sedombo, pamusoro pokwakadzika pachioma nechando?
018	JOB	038	031	“Ungagona kusunga nyeredzi dzeChimutanhatu here? Iwe ungasunungura mabote eOrioni here?
018	JOB	038	032	Ungabudisa mapoka enyeredzi panguva yadzo here, kana kutungamirira Akuturo navana vayo?
018	JOB	038	033	Unoziva mitemo yokumatenga here? Ungagona kumisa umambo hwaMwari pamusoro penyika here?
018	JOB	038	034	“Ko, iwe ungasvitsa inzwi rako kumakore here, uye ugozvifukidza namafashamu emvura?
018	JOB	038	035	Ko, iwe unotuma mheni panzira yayo here? Ko, zvinodzoka kuzokuzivisa iwe here kuti isu tiri pano?
018	JOB	038	036	Ndianiko akaisa uchenjeri mumwoyo, kana kupa kunzwisisa kundangariro?
018	JOB	038	037	Ndianiko ane uchenjeri hwokuverenga makore? Ndianiko angagona kuteura matende emvura okudenga,
018	JOB	038	038	kana guruva raoma, uye mavhinga enyika anamatirana?
018	JOB	038	039	“Ko, iwe ungavhimira shumbakadzi chokudya here, uye ungagutsa shumba panzara yadzo here,
018	JOB	038	040	kana dzichitsivama mumapako adzo kana kuti dzakavandira mudenhere?
018	JOB	038	041	Ndianiko anopa gunguo zvokudya kana vana varo vachichema kuna Mwari, uye vachidzungaira pose pose nokushayiwa zvokudya?
018	JOB	039	001	“Iwe unoziva nguva inobereka ngururu here? Unocherechedza kana nondo dzichibereka vana vadzo here?
018	JOB	039	002	Unoverenga mwedzi kusvikira dzabereka here? Unoziva nguva yadzinobereka here?
018	JOB	039	003	Dzinotsivama pasi dzigobereka vana vadzo; kurwadziwa kwadzo kwapera.
018	JOB	039	004	Vana vadzo vanowanda vagokura vakasimba musango; vanoenda uye havadzokizve.
018	JOB	039	005	“Ndianiko akaregedza mbizi ichienda? Ndianiko akasunungura tambo dzayo?
018	JOB	039	006	Ndakaipa renje kuti uve musha wayo, nyika yomunyu sougaro hwayo.
018	JOB	039	007	Inoseka bope riri muguta; hainzwi kudaidzira kwomuchairi.
018	JOB	039	008	Inoita zvikomo mafuro ayo uye inotsvaka zvinhu zvose zvinenge zvakapfumvudza.
018	JOB	039	009	“Ko, nyati ingabvuma kukushandira here? Ko, ingagara mudanga rako usiku here?
018	JOB	039	010	Ko, ungagona kuifambisa mumiforo namahanisi here? Ko, ingarima mipata mushure mako here?
018	JOB	039	011	Ungavimba nesimba rayo guru here? Ko, ungaisiyira basa rako rinorema here?
018	JOB	039	012	Ungavimba nayo kuti ikutakurire zviyo zvako uye igozviunza paburiro rako here?
018	JOB	039	013	“Mapapiro emhou anopapama nomufaro mukuru, asi haangaenzaniswi namapapiro uye neminhenga yedambiramurove.
018	JOB	039	014	Zvirokwazvo inokandira mazai ayo muvhu igoarega achidziyirwa mujecha,
018	JOB	039	015	isina hanya kuti rutsoka rungaapwanya, kana kuti mhuka dzesango dzingaatsika.
018	JOB	039	016	Inobata vana vayo noukasha, kunge vasati vari vayo; haina hanya kuti yakatambudzika pasina,
018	JOB	039	017	nokuti Mwari haana kuisa njere mairi kana kuipa mugove wepfungwa dzakanaka.
018	JOB	039	018	Asi kana ikatambanudza mapapiro ayo kuti imhanye, inoseka bhiza nomutasvi waro.
018	JOB	039	019	“Iwe unopa bhiza simba raro kana kushongedza mutsipa waro nezenze rinopepereka here?
018	JOB	039	020	Ndiwe unoita kuti rikwakuke semhashu, richivhundutsira nokupfeza, kwokuzvikudza kwaro here?
018	JOB	039	021	Rinoteta risingatyi, richifarira simba raro, rigobuda richienda kundorwa.
018	JOB	039	022	Rinoseka kutya, harina charinotya; haritizi munondo.
018	JOB	039	023	Goba remiseve rinorira parutivi paro, pamwe chete nepfumo nebakatwa zvinovaima.
018	JOB	039	024	Neshungu rinodya ivhu; harigoni kumira rakadzikama kana richinzwa kurira kwehwamanda.
018	JOB	039	025	Pakurira kwehwamanda rinopfeza, roti, ‘Hekani!’ Rinofembedza hwema hwehondo ichiri kure, kudanidzira kwavakuru vehondo nemheremhere yehondo.
018	JOB	039	026	“Ko, rukodzi runobhururuka nouchenjeri hwako here parunotambanudza mapapiro arwo rwakananga zasi?
018	JOB	039	027	Ko, gondo rinobhururuka nokuda kwokurayira kwako here richindovaka dendere raro pakakwirira?
018	JOB	039	028	Rinogara pamawere uye rinovatapo usiku; shongwe yedombo ndiyo nhare yaro.
018	JOB	039	029	Riri ipapo rinotsvaka zvokudya zvaro; meso aro anozviona zvichiri kure.
018	JOB	039	030	Vana varo vanodya ropa, uye pane chakaurayiwa ndipo pariri.”
018	JOB	040	001	Jehovha akati kuna Jobho:
018	JOB	040	002	“Ko, munhu anokakavadzana noWamasimba Ose angamurayira here? Anopomera Mwari mhosva ngaamupindure!”
018	JOB	040	003	Ipapo Jobho akapindura Jehovha akati:
018	JOB	040	004	“Ini handina maturo, ndingakupindurai seiko? Ndafumbira muromo wangu.
018	JOB	040	005	Ndakataura kamwe chete, asi handina mhinduro, kaviri, asi handichapamhidzazve.”
018	JOB	040	006	Ipapo Jehovha akataura naJobho ari mudutu akati:
018	JOB	040	007	“Chizvisunga chiuno somurume; ini ndichakubvunza, uye iwe uchandipindura.
018	JOB	040	008	“Ko, iwe unoda kukanganisa kururamisira kwangu here? Ko, unondipomera kuti uzviruramise here?
018	JOB	040	009	Uno ruoko rwakaita sorwaMwari here, uye inzwi rako ringatinhira serake here?
018	JOB	040	010	Chizvishongedza zvino nokukudzwa uye nokubwinya, uye zvishongedze nokuremekedzwa uye noumambo.
018	JOB	040	011	Regedzera ukasha hwehasha dzako, utarire munhu mumwe nomumwe anozvikudza ugomuderedza,
018	JOB	040	012	tarira murume mumwe nomumwe anozvikudza ugomuninipisa, pwanya vakaipa ipapo pavamire.
018	JOB	040	013	Uvavige vose pamwe chete muguruva; ufukidze zviso zvavo muguva.
018	JOB	040	014	Ipapo ini pachangu ndichabvuma kwauri kuti ruoko rwako rworudyi rungakuponesa.
018	JOB	040	015	“Tarisa kumvuu, yandakaita pamwe chete newe uye inofura uswa senzombe.
018	JOB	040	016	Simba rainaro muchiuno chayo, kusimba kwayo kuri mumakakava edumbu rayo.
018	JOB	040	017	Muswe wayo unotsvikidza somusidhari; marunda ezvidya zvayo akasonanidzwa.
018	JOB	040	018	Mapfupa ayo ipombi dzendarira, miromo yayo yakaita setsvimbo dzesimbi.
018	JOB	040	019	Iyo iri pachinzvimbo chokutanga pakati pamabasa aMwari, asi Muiti wayo anogona kusvika pairi nomunondo wake.
018	JOB	040	020	Zvikomo zvinoivigira zvibereko zvayo, uye zvikara zvose zvesango zvinotambira pedyo nayo.
018	JOB	040	021	Inovata pasi pemiti yemirotasi yakavanda pakati petsanga munhope.
018	JOB	040	022	Mirotasi inoivanza pamimvuri yayo; mikonachando iri mujinga morukova inoipoteredza.
018	JOB	040	023	Panozara rwizi, iyo haivhunduki; inodekara zvayo, kunyange Jorodhani rukapfachukira kumuromo wayo.
018	JOB	040	024	Pano munhu angagona kuibata neziso, kana kuiteya uye nokuibaya pamhino yayo here?
018	JOB	041	001	“Ungagona kukweva ngwena nechiredzo, kana kusunga rurimi rwayo netambo here?
018	JOB	041	002	Ungagona kupinza mukaro mumhino dzayo, kana kuboora rushaya rwayo nechiredzo here?
018	JOB	041	003	Ko, ingaramba ichikumbira kunzwirwa ngoni newe here? Ko, ingataura kwauri mashoko manyoro here?
018	JOB	041	004	Ko, ingaita chitenderano newe here kuti iwe uitore senhapwa kwoupenyu hwayo hwose?
018	JOB	041	005	Ungagona kuipfuwa seshiri here kana kuisunga kuti vanasikana vako vatambe nayo?
018	JOB	041	006	Ko, vatengesi vangaitsinhanisa here? Ko, vangaigoverana pakati pavashambadziri here?
018	JOB	041	007	Ungagona kuzadza dehwe rayo nemiseve ine nzeve here, kana kuzadza musoro wayo namapfumo okuredzesa hove?
018	JOB	041	008	Kana ukaisa ruoko rwako pairi uchazorangarira kurwisana kwako nayo uye haungazozvipamhizve!
018	JOB	041	009	Tariro ipi zvayo yokuitonga ndeyenhema; kungoiona bedzi kunopedza simba.
018	JOB	041	010	Hakuna munhu anotyisa zvokuti angaidenha. Ndianiko zvino anogona kumisidzana neni?
018	JOB	041	011	Ndianiko wandakatorera chinhu wandinofanira kuripira? Zvinhu zvose zviri pasi pedenga ndezvangu.
018	JOB	041	012	“Handingakonewi kutaura zvemitezo yayo, simba rayo uye chimiro chayo chakanaka.
018	JOB	041	013	Ndianiko angabvisa dehwe rayo? Ndianiko angasvika kwairi namatomu?
018	JOB	041	014	Ndianiko anotsunga kuzarura mikova yomuromo wayo, iwo wakakomberedzwa nameno ayo anotyisa?
018	JOB	041	015	Musana wayo une mitsara yamakwande yakanyatsonamirwa pamwe chete;
018	JOB	041	016	rimwe nerimwe riri pedyo pedyo nerimwe, zvokuti hakuna mhepo inopinda napakati.
018	JOB	041	017	Akanyatsobatanidzwa pane rimwe nerimwe; akanamatirana pamwe chete uye haagoni kuparadzaniswa.
018	JOB	041	018	Kuhotsira kwayo kunoita mamvari omoto; meso ayo akaita sehwerazuva hwamambakwedza.
018	JOB	041	019	Mazhenje omoto anoyerera achibva mumuromo mayo; zvimvari zvomoto zvinobarikira kunze.
018	JOB	041	020	Utsi hunobuda mumhino dzayo sepahari inovira pamusoro pomoto wetsanga.
018	JOB	041	021	Kufema kwayo kunopfutidza mazimbe omoto, uye murazvo unobuda mumuromo mayo.
018	JOB	041	022	Simba rinogara pamutsipa wayo; kuvhundutsa kuri pamberi payo.
018	JOB	041	023	Nhindi dzenyama yayo dzakabatanidzwa zvakasimba; dzakasimba uye hadzizungunuswi.
018	JOB	041	024	Chipfuva chayo chakaoma sebwe, chakaoma sapasi peguyo.
018	JOB	041	025	Painosimuka, vane simba vanovhundutswa, vanodududzira shure isati yarova mvura.
018	JOB	041	026	Munondo unosvika kwairi hauna simba, uye pfumo kana museve kana pfumo guru hazvina simba.
018	JOB	041	027	Simbi inoita seshanga kwairi, uye ndarira sedanda rakaora.
018	JOB	041	028	Miseve haingaiti kuti itize; zvimviriri zvakaita sehundi kwairi.
018	JOB	041	029	Tsvimbo inoita kunge chidimbu cheshanga kwairi; inoseka panorira bakatwa.
018	JOB	041	030	Pasi payo pakaita sezvaenga zvehari, inosiya muhwezva mumatope sechirei chinokwevewa.
018	JOB	041	031	Inoita kuti mvura yakadzika ivire segate rinovhaira, uye inokurunga gungwa sehari yamafuta.
018	JOB	041	032	Shure kwayo inosiya muhwezva unopenya; mumwe munhu angafunga kuti mvura yakadzika yava nevhudzijena.
018	JOB	041	033	Hapana chakaenzana nayo munyika, chisikwa chisingatyi.
018	JOB	041	034	Inotarisira pasi zvose zvinozvikudza; ndiyo mambo pamusoro pezvose zvinozvikudza.”
018	JOB	042	001	Ipapo Jobho akapindura kuna Jehovha akati:
018	JOB	042	002	“Ndinoziva kuti imi munogona kuita zvose; hapana urongwa hwenyu hungakoneswa.
018	JOB	042	003	Mabvunza kuti, ‘Ndianiko uyu anodzikatira zano rangu iye asina zivo?’ Zvirokwazvo ndakataura pamusoro pezvinhu zvandisinganzwisisi, zvinhu zvinoshamisa kwazvo kuti ini ndizvizive.
018	JOB	042	004	“Mati imi, ‘Chinzwa zvino, uye ini ndichataura; ndichakubvunza iwe, uye iwe uchandipindura.’
018	JOB	042	005	Nzeve dzangu dzakanga dzanzwa nezvenyu, asi zvino meso angu akuonai imi.
018	JOB	042	006	Naizvozvo ndinozvishora pachangu, uye ndinotendeuka hangu muguruva nomumadota.”
018	JOB	042	007	Jehovha akati areva zvinhu izvi kuna Jobho, akati kuna Erifazi muTemani, “Ndakakutsamwira iwe neshamwari dzako mbiri, nokuti hamuna kutaura zvakarurama pamusoro pangu, sezvakaitwa nomuranda wangu Jobho.
018	JOB	042	008	Saka zvino chitorai hando nomwe namakondobwe manomwe mugoenda kumuranda wangu Jobho mundozvibayira sechipiriso chenyu chinopiswa. Muranda wangu Jobho achakunyengetererai, uye ini ndichagamuchira munyengetero wake ndigorega kukuitirai zvakafanira upenzi hwenyu. Hamuna kutaura zvakarurama pamusoro pangu, somuranda wangu Jobho.”
018	JOB	042	009	Saka Erifazi muTemani, Bhiridhadhi muShuhi naZofari muNamaati vakaita zvavakaudzwa naJehovha; uye Jehovha akagamuchira munyengetero waJobho.
018	JOB	042	010	Shure kwokunge Jobho anyengeterera shamwari dzake, Jehovha akaita kuti abudirirezve akamupa zvakapetwa kaviri kupfuura zvaakanga anazvo kare.
018	JOB	042	011	Vanunʼuna vake vose nehanzvadzi dzake navose vaimuziva vakauya vakadya pamwe chete naye mumba make. Vakamuvaraidza uye vakamunyaradza pamusoro pamatambudziko akanga aiswa naJehovha pamusoro pake, uye mumwe nomumwe wavo akamupa chidimbu chesirivha nemhete yegoridhe.
018	JOB	042	012	Jehovha akaropafadza kupedzisira kwoupenyu hwaJobho kupfuura kutanga. Akanga ana makwai zviuru gumi nezvina, zviuru zvitanhatu zvengamera, nenzombe dzingasungwa pamajoko chiuru nembongoro chiuru.
018	JOB	042	013	Uye akazovawo navanakomana vanomwe navanasikana vatatu.
018	JOB	042	014	Mwanasikana wake wokutanga akamutumidza zita rokuti Jemima, wechipiri akamuti Kezia uye wechitatu akamutumidza kuti Kereni-Hapuki.
018	JOB	042	015	Panyika yose hapana kuwanikwa vakadzi vakanaka kupinda vanasikana vaJobho, uye baba vavo vakavapa nhaka pamwe chete nehanzvadzi dzavo.
018	JOB	042	016	Shure kwaizvozvi, akazorarama makore zana namakumi mana; akaona vana vake navana vavana vake kusvikira parudzi rwechina.
018	JOB	042	017	Nokudaro akafa, akwegura ava namakore mazhinji.
#
# BOOK	019	PSA	Psalms	Mapisarema
019	PSA	001	001	Akaropafadzwa munhu asingafambi panorangana vakaipa, asingamiri panzira yavatadzi, asingagari pachigaro chavadadi.
019	PSA	001	002	Asi anofarira murayiro waJehovha, uye anofungisisa murayiro wake masikati nousiku.
019	PSA	001	003	Akafanana nomuti wakasimwa pahova dzemvura, unobereka michero yawo nenguva yawo, uye mashizha awo haasvavi. Chinhu chipi nechipi chaanoita chinoendeka.
019	PSA	001	004	Vakaipa havana kudaro! Vakafanana nehundi inopepereswa nemhepo.
019	PSA	001	005	Naizvozvo vakaipa havangamiri pakutongwa, kana vatadzi paungano yavakarurama.
019	PSA	001	006	Nokuti Jehovha anotarira nzira yavakarurama, asi nzira yavakaipa ichaparadzwa.
019	PSA	002	001	Ndudzi dzinoitireiko bope? Uye vanhu vanofungireiko zvisina maturo?
019	PSA	002	002	Madzimambo enyika azvigadzirira uye vabati vanoungana pamwe chete kuti vazorwa naJehovha, uye kuti vazorwisa Muzodziwa Wake.
019	PSA	002	003	Vanoti, “Ngatidamburei ngetani dzavo, tigorasa mabote avo.”
019	PSA	002	004	Iye agere pachigaro choushe chokudenga anoseka; Ishe anovadadira.
019	PSA	002	005	Ipapo anovatuka mukutsamwa kwake uye anovavhundutsa muhasha dzake, achiti,
019	PSA	002	006	“Ndakagadza Mambo wangu paZioni, gomo rangu dzvene.”
019	PSA	002	007	Ndichaparidza chirevo chaJehovha, ndichiti: Iye akati kwandiri, “Ndiwe Mwanakomana wangu; nhasi ndava Baba vako.
019	PSA	002	008	Kumbira kwandiri, uye ndichaita kuti ndudzi dzive nhaka yako, migumo yenyika ive yako.
019	PSA	002	009	Uchavatonga netsvimbo yesimbi; uchavaputsa kuita zvimedu zvimedu sehari.”
019	PSA	002	010	Naizvozvo, imi madzimambo, ngwarai; munyeverwe, imi vabati venyika.
019	PSA	002	011	Shumirai Jehovha nokutya, uye mufare nokudedera.
019	PSA	002	012	Tsvodai Mwanakomana, kuti arege kutsamwa mukazoparadzwa munzira yenyu, nokuti hasha dzake dzingakurumidza kumuka. Vakaropafadzwa vose vanovanda maari.
019	PSA	003	001	Pisarema raDhavhidhi. Panguva yaakatiza Abhusaromu mwanakomana wake. Haiwa Jehovha, vadzivisi vangu vakawanda sei! Vakawanda sei vanondimukira!
019	PSA	003	002	Vazhinji vanoti kwandiri, “Mwari haangamudzikinuri.” Sera
019	PSA	003	003	Asi imi Jehovha, muri nhoo yakandipoteredza; munoisa rukudzo pandiri uye munosimudza musoro wangu.
019	PSA	003	004	Kuna Jehovha ndinodana nenzwi guru, uye anondipindura ari pagomo rake dzvene. Sera
019	PSA	003	005	Ndinovata pasi ndigokotsira; ndinomukazve, nokuti Jehovha anonditsigira.
019	PSA	003	006	Handizotyi makumi ezviuru vakandikomba kuti vandirwise.
019	PSA	003	007	Simukai, imi Jehovha! Ndirwirei, imi Mwari wangu! Rovai vavengi vangu vose pashaya; gurai meno avakaipa.
019	PSA	003	008	Rusununguko runobva kuna Jehovha. Maropafadzo enyu ngaave pamusoro pavanhu venyu. Sera
019	PSA	004	001	Kumutungamiri wenziyo nemitengeranwa. Pisarema raDhavhidhi. Ndipindurei pandinodana kwamuri, imi Mwari wangu makarurama. Ndisunungurei pakutambudzika kwangu; ndinzwirei ngoni uye munzwe munyengetero wangu.
