019	PSA	102	001	Munyengetero womunhu anotambudzika. Paanenge aziya uye odurura kuchema kwake pamberi paJehovha. Inzwai munyengetero wangu, imi Jehovha; kuchemera kwangu rubatsiro ngakusvike kwamuri.
019	PSA	102	002	Regai kundivanzira chiso chenyu pandinenge ndichitambudzika. Rerekerai nzeve yenyu kwandiri; pandinokudanai, ndipindurei nokukurumidza.
019	PSA	102	003	Nokuti mazuva angu anopera soutsi; mapfupa angu anopisa samazimbe anopfuta.
