042	LUK	001	006	Vose vakanga vakarurama pamberi paMwari, vachichengeta mirayiro yaShe yose nezvaakatema, vasina zvavangapomerwa.
042	LUK	001	007	Asi vakanga vasina vana, nokuti Erizabheti akanga asingabereki; uye vose vari vaviri vakanga vachembera kwazvo.
042	LUK	001	008	Mumwe musi Zekaria akati ari pabasa reboka rake achibata somuprista pamberi paMwari,
042	LUK	001	009	akasarudzwa nomujenya, maererano netsika youprista, kuti aende andopisa zvinonhuhwira mutemberi yaShe.
042	LUK	001	010	Uye nguva yokupisa zvinonhuhwira yakati yasvika, vanamati vose vakaungana panze vachinyengetera.
042	LUK	001	011	Ipapo mutumwa waShe akazviratidza kwaari, akamira kurutivi rworudyi rwearitari yezvinonhuhwira.
042	LUK	001	012	Zekaria akati achimuona, akavhunduka uye akabatwa nokutya.
042	LUK	001	013	Asi mutumwa akati kwaari, “Usatya, Zekaria; munyengetero wako wanzwikwa. Mukadzi wako Erizabheti achakuberekera mwanakomana, uye unofanira kumutumidza zita rokuti Johani.
042	LUK	001	014	Achava mufaro nokufarisisa kwamuri, uye vazhinji vachafara nokuda kwokuberekwa kwake,
042	LUK	001	015	nokuti achava mukuru pamberi paShe. Haafaniri kutongonwa waini kana zvinonwiwa zvose zvakaviriswa, uye achazadzwa noMweya Mutsvene kunyange kubva pakuberekwa kwake.
042	LUK	001	016	Achadzorera vanhu vazhinji vaIsraeri kuna She Mwari wavo.
