048	GAL	001	018	Ipapo shure kwamakore matatu, ndakakwira kuJerusarema kuti ndinozivana naPetro uye ndikandogara naye kwamazuva gumi namashanu.
048	GAL	001	019	Handina kuona vamwe vavapostori, kunze kwaJakobho mununʼuna waShe.
